rt	␀␀Request body must contain JSON.␀Invalid JSON: ␀␀JSON body must be an object.␀␀␀␀hostname must be a string.␀␀tcp_token␀␀␀tcp_token must be a string.␀tcp_token must be 0-64 characters.␀␀tcp_port␀␀␀␀tcp_port must be an integer.␀␀␀␀tcp_port must be between 1 and 65535.␀␀␀use_static_ip␀␀␀wifi_external_antenna␀␀␀wifi_power_save␀wifi_power_save must be true or false.␀␀gps_enabled is not supported on this board.␀gps_enabled must be true or false.␀␀pa_high_power_enabled␀␀␀PA mode control is not supported on this board.␀pa_high_power_enabled must be true or false.␀␀␀␀station_g3_external_lna_enabled␀Station G3 external LNA control is not supported on this board.␀station_g3_external_lna_enabled must be true or false.␀␀heltec_v43_external_lna_enabled␀network␀network must be an object.␀␀network.use_static_ip must be true or false.␀␀␀␀network.static_ip␀␀␀network.subnet␀␀network.gateway␀network.dns1␀␀␀␀network.dns2␀␀␀␀network.wifi_external_antenna is not supported on this board.␀␀␀network.wifi_external_antenna must be true or false.␀␀␀␀network.heltec_v43_external_lna_enabled is not supported on this board.␀network.heltec_v43_external_lna_enabled must be true or false.␀␀network.agc_reset_interval_sec is not supported on this board.␀␀network.agc_reset_interval_sec must be an integer from 0 to 3600.␀␀␀network.agc_reset_interval_sec must be between 0 and 3600.␀␀static_ip, subnet, and gateway are required when use_static_ip is true.␀Failed to save Station G3 RF front-end settings.␀␀␀␀Failed to save Heltec V4.3 LNA setting.␀Failed to save agc.reset.interval setting.␀␀[OTA] API config updated by %s
